"P1658622802" "Funny thing is, I'm an auto-issue contact, so you should probably never see this."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1917528265" "Hello, I'm the Studio Manager for Architect Entertainment. I make sure each facility is functioning to its highest potential so that you, our 'talent', get the most out of your visit."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1945037072" "I've shown you all I can. I recommend you head upstairs and start working on some stories for all of us."
